          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier\nfrom sklearn.metrics import roc_auc_score\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import StratifiedGroupKFold, StratifiedKFold, cross_val_score\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2912)\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Scikit-Learn 1.9: Rekam Medis Multi-Kunjungan Pasien (200 Pasien x 8 Kunjungan)\n# 150 pasien pertama = data pengembangan CV; 50 pasien terakhir = Holdout Produksi Baru\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nn_patients = 200\nvisits_each = 8\npatient_id = np.repeat(np.arange(n_patients), visits_each)\nn_total = len(patient_id)\n\n# Risiko kronis laten per pasien + sidik jari statis (usia eksak, BMI, Hb, kreatinin)\npatient_risk = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=n_patients)\np_fp1 = rng.normal(50.0, 12.0, size=n_patients)\np_fp2 = rng.normal(24.5, 4.0, size=n_patients)\np_fp3 = rng.normal(13.2, 1.8, size=n_patients)\np_fp4 = rng.normal(0.95, 0.25, size=n_patients)\n\nX_fp = np.column_stack([\n    p_fp1[patient_id] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.015, size=n_total),\n    p_fp2[patient_id] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.020, size=n_total),\n    p_fp3[patient_id] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.020, size=n_total),\n    p_fp4[patient_id] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.008, size=n_total),\n])\n\n# 4 fitur klinis dinamis kunjungan (f0 & f1 adalah sinyal kausal lintas pasien)\nX_dyn = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_total, 4))\nlatent_score = 1.65 * X_dyn[:, 0] - 1.35 * X_dyn[:, 1] + 3.20 * patient_risk[patient_id]\ny = (latent_score + rng.normal(0.0, 0.55, size=n_total) > 1.45).astype(int)\nX = np.hstack([X_dyn, X_fp])\n\n# Pisahkan 150 pasien untuk CV dan 50 pasien benar-benar baru sebagai simulasi produksi live\ndev_mask = patient_id < 150\nX_dev, y_dev, g_dev = X[dev_mask], y[dev_mask], patient_id[dev_mask]\nX_prod, y_prod = X[~dev_mask], y[~dev_mask]\n\nclf = RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=80, max_depth=None, min_samples_leaf=1, random_state=42)\n\nskf = StratifiedKFold(n_splits=5, shuffle=True, random_state=42)\nsgkf = StratifiedGroupKFold(n_splits=5)\n\nauc_leaky = cross_val_score(clf, X_dev, y_dev, cv=skf, scoring=\"roc_auc\")\nauc_honest = cross_val_score(clf, X_dev, y_dev, cv=sgkf, groups=g_dev, scoring=\"roc_auc\")\n\nclf.fit(X_dev, y_dev)\nauc_prod = roc_auc_score(y_prod, clf.predict_proba(X_prod)[:, 1])\n\n# Audit berapa persen pasien di val yang juga muncul di train pada StratifiedKFold\nleak_fracs = []\nfor tr, va in skf.split(X_dev, y_dev):\n    va_g = set(g_dev[va])\n    tr_g = set(g_dev[tr])\n    leak_fracs.append(len(va_g & tr_g) / len(va_g))\n\nprint(f\"=== Audit Entity Leakage Pasien (Dev: {len(y_dev)} baris / 150 pasien | Prod Baru: {len(y_prod)} baris / 50 pasien) ===\")\nprint(f\"Rata-rata pasien validasi yang BOCOR di train (StratifiedKFold) : {np.mean(leak_fracs):.1%}\")\nprint(f\"1. StratifiedKFold(shuffle=True)  [BOCOR]   : AUROC = {auc_leaky.mean():.4f} +/- {auc_leaky.std():.4f}\")\nprint(f\"2. StratifiedGroupKFold(groups)   [JUJUR]   : AUROC = {auc_honest.mean():.4f} +/- {auc_honest.std():.4f}\")\nprint(f\"3. Holdout Pasien Baru Produksi   [REALITA] : AUROC = {auc_prod:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Ilusi Optimisme Palsu StratifiedKFold       : +{auc_leaky.mean() - auc_prod:.4f} AUROC di atas produksi!\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Audit Entity Leakage Pasien (Dev: 1200 baris / 150 pasien | Prod Baru: 400 baris / 50 pasien) ===\nRata-rata pasien validasi yang BOCOR di train (StratifiedKFold) : 100.0%\n1. StratifiedKFold(shuffle=True)  [BOCOR]   : AUROC = 0.8837 +/- 0.0125\n2. StratifiedGroupKFold(groups)   [JUJUR]   : AUROC = 0.6406 +/- 0.0963\n3. Holdout Pasien Baru Produksi   [REALITA] : AUROC = 0.7383\nIlusi Optimisme Palsu StratifiedKFold       : +0.1454 AUROC di atas produksi!",
