          "actualOutput": "=== Audit Temporal Leakage Deret Waktu (N=779 hari, Horizon H=7, Rolling=14) ===\n1. KFold(shuffle=True) [BOCOR]   | ACAK (BOCOR!)   | Mean R2 = +0.5058 | Mean RMSE = 7.0313\n2. TimeSeriesSplit(gap=0)        | min_gap= 0 hari | Mean R2 = +0.0822 | Mean RMSE = 8.7782\n3. TimeSeriesSplit(gap=14)       | min_gap=14 hari | Mean R2 = +0.1276 | Mean RMSE = 8.5400",
