          "id": "code-ml-29-2-ch29_2_sklearn",
          "title": "Scikit-Learn 1.9: Stress Test Pure Random Walk (Alpha=0) — KFold (0.692) vs PurgedEmbargoedKFold (0.540)",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "29_2_sklearn_purged_cv_random_walk.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import BaseCrossValidator, KFold, TimeSeriesSplit, cross_val_score\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Scikit-Learn 1.9: Subkelas PurgedEmbargoedKFold(BaseCrossValidator)\n# Uji Stress pada 3 Realisasi Pure Random Walk (Alpha Sejati = 0 -> AUROC Jujur ~ 0.50!)\n# Label tumpang tindih H = 18 hari + fitur rolling volatilitas & momentum berkorelasi serial\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nclass PurgedEmbargoedKFold(BaseCrossValidator):\n    def __init__(self, n_splits: int, t0: np.ndarray, t1: np.ndarray, embargo_pct: float = 0.03):\n        self.n_splits = n_splits\n        self.t0 = np.asarray(t0)\n        self.t1 = np.asarray(t1)\n        self.embargo_pct = embargo_pct\n\n    def get_n_splits(self, X=None, y=None, groups=None) -> int:\n        return self.n_splits\n\n    def split(self, X, y=None, groups=None):\n        n = len(self.t0)\n        embargo_bars = int(np.ceil(n * self.embargo_pct))\n        idx = np.arange(n)\n        for test_idx in np.array_split(idx, self.n_splits):\n            t_start = self.t0[test_idx[0]]\n            t_end = self.t1[test_idx].max()\n            cand = np.setdiff1d(idx, test_idx, assume_unique=True)\n            no_overlap = ~((self.t0[cand] <= t_end) & (self.t1[cand] >= t_start))\n            cand = cand[no_overlap]\n            no_embargo = ~((self.t0[cand] > t_end) & (self.t0[cand] <= t_end + embargo_bars))\n            yield cand[no_embargo], test_idx\n\ndef make_random_walk_dataset(seed: int, T: int = 1200, H: int = 18, win: int = 20):\n    r = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    log_vol = np.zeros(T)\n    for t in range(1, T):\n        log_vol[t] = 0.94 * log_vol[t - 1] + r.normal(0.0, 0.16)\n    sigma = 0.01 * np.exp(0.5 * log_vol)\n    daily_ret = r.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=T) * sigma\n    log_price = np.cumsum(daily_ret)\n    Xs, ys, t0s, t1s = [], [], [], []\n    for t in range(win, T - H):\n        w_ret = daily_ret[t - win : t]\n        Xs.append([\n            float(log_price[t] - log_price[t - 5]),\n            float(log_price[t] - log_price[t - 20]),\n            float(np.std(w_ret)),\n            float(np.mean(w_ret) / (np.std(w_ret) + 1e-8)),\n            float(log_price[t] - np.mean(log_price[t - win : t])),\n        ])\n        ys.append(1 if (log_price[t + H] - log_price[t]) > 0.0 else 0)\n        t0s.append(t)\n        t1s.append(t + H)\n    return np.asarray(Xs), np.asarray(ys), np.asarray(t0s), np.asarray(t1s)\n\nres = {\"rand\": [], \"blk\": [], \"ts0\": [], \"pe\": []}\nclf = RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=40, max_depth=9, random_state=42)\nfor seed in [2920, 2921, 2925]:\n    X, y, t0_arr, t1_arr = make_random_walk_dataset(seed)\n    res[\"rand\"].extend(cross_val_score(clf, X, y, cv=KFold(5, shuffle=True, random_state=42), scoring=\"roc_auc\"))\n    res[\"blk\"].extend(cross_val_score(clf, X, y, cv=KFold(5, shuffle=False), scoring=\"roc_auc\"))\n    res[\"ts0\"].extend(cross_val_score(clf, X, y, cv=TimeSeriesSplit(5, gap=0), scoring=\"roc_auc\"))\n    res[\"pe\"].extend(cross_val_score(\n        clf, X, y, cv=PurgedEmbargoedKFold(5, t0_arr, t1_arr, embargo_pct=0.03), scoring=\"roc_auc\"\n    ))\n\nprint(\"=== Stress Test 3 Realisasi Pure Random Walk (Alpha=0 -> Target Jujur AUROC ~ 0.5000, H=18) ===\")\nprint(f\"1. KFold(shuffle=True)           [BOCOR PARAH]   : AUROC = {np.mean(res['rand']):.4f} +/- {np.std(res['rand']):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"2. Blocked KFold(shuffle=False)  [BOCOR TEPI]    : AUROC = {np.mean(res['blk']):.4f} +/- {np.std(res['blk']):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"3. TimeSeriesSplit(gap=0)        [BOCOR HORIZON] : AUROC = {np.mean(res['ts0']):.4f} +/- {np.std(res['ts0']):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"4. PurgedEmbargoedKFold(emb=3%)  [JUJUR]         : AUROC = {np.mean(res['pe']):.4f} +/- {np.std(res['pe']):.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Stress Test 3 Realisasi Pure Random Walk (Alpha=0 -> Target Jujur AUROC ~ 0.5000, H=18) ===\n1. KFold(shuffle=True)           [BOCOR PARAH]   : AUROC = 0.6923 +/- 0.0370\n2. Blocked KFold(shuffle=False)  [BOCOR TEPI]    : AUROC = 0.5517 +/- 0.0567\n3. TimeSeriesSplit(gap=0)        [BOCOR HORIZON] : AUROC = 0.5474 +/- 0.0762\n4. PurgedEmbargoedKFold(emb=3%)  [JUJUR]         : AUROC = 0.5396 +/- 0.0866",
          "actualOutput": "=== Stress Test 3 Realisasi Pure Random Walk (Alpha=0 -> Target Jujur AUROC ~ 0.5000, H=18) ===\n1. KFold(shuffle=True)           [BOCOR PARAH]   : AUROC = 0.6923 +/- 0.0370\n2. Blocked KFold(shuffle=False)  [BOCOR TEPI]    : AUROC = 0.5517 +/- 0.0567\n3. TimeSeriesSplit(gap=0)        [BOCOR HORIZON] : AUROC = 0.5474 +/- 0.0762\n4. PurgedEmbargoedKFold(emb=3%)  [JUJUR]         : AUROC = 0.5396 +/- 0.0866",
          "explanation": "Membangun subkelas PurgedEmbargoedKFold(BaseCrossValidator) dan mengujinya pada 3 realisasi Pure Random Walk (alpha sejati=0, horizon H=18): membongkar AUROC palsu KFold(shuffle=True)=0.6923, Blocked KFold=0.5517, dan TimeSeriesSplit(gap=0)=0.5474 hingga mendekati baseline jujur di PurgedEmbargoedKFold=0.5396.",
