          "id": "code-ml-29-4-ch29_4_diag",
          "title": "Production Audit: Clustered vs Naive Bootstrap (3.84x!), Diebold-Mariano vs t-test & Jebakan N=100k",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "29_4_clustered_bootstrap_dm_mdbe_audit.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy import stats\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2943)\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Production Audit:\n# 1. Naive Row Bootstrap vs Clustered Bootstrap pada Data Multi-Transaksi/Pasien\n# 2. Naive Paired t-test vs Diebold-Mariano HAC pada Residual Deret Waktu Autokorelasi\n# 3. Statistical Significance vs Practical Significance (MDBE) pada N = 100.000\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nn_clusters = 80\nrows_per_cluster = 15\ncluster_ids = np.repeat(np.arange(n_clusters), rows_per_cluster)\nN = len(cluster_ids)\n\n# True mean delta_loss = 0.000 dengan korelasi intra-klaster kuat (efek merchant/pasien!)\ncluster_shift = rng.normal(0.0, 0.085, size=n_clusters)\nrow_noise = rng.normal(0.0, 0.025, size=N)\nloss_diff = cluster_shift[cluster_ids] + row_noise\n\nB = 1000\nnaive_means = np.empty(B)\nclust_means = np.empty(B)\n\ncluster_slices = [loss_diff[c * rows_per_cluster : (c + 1) * rows_per_cluster] for c in range(n_clusters)]\ncluster_means_arr = np.array([s.mean() for s in cluster_slices])\n\nfor b in range(B):\n    naive_means[b] = float(np.mean(rng.choice(loss_diff, size=N, replace=True)))\n    clust_means[b] = float(np.mean(rng.choice(cluster_means_arr, size=n_clusters, replace=True)))\n\nci_naive = np.percentile(naive_means, [2.5, 97.5])\nci_clust = np.percentile(clust_means, [2.5, 97.5])\nwidth_naive = float(ci_naive[1] - ci_naive[0])\nwidth_clust = float(ci_clust[1] - ci_clust[0])\n\nprint(f\"=== 1. Audit Naive Bootstrap vs Clustered Bootstrap (G={n_clusters} entitas x {rows_per_cluster} baris = {N}) ===\")\nprint(f\"Observed Mean Loss Diff        : {loss_diff.mean():+.5f}\")\nprint(f\"Naive Row Bootstrap 95% CI     : [{ci_naive[0]:+.5f}, {ci_naive[1]:+.5f}] (lebar = {width_naive:.5f}) <-- TERLALU SEMPIT!\")\nprint(f\"Clustered Bootstrap 95% CI     : [{ci_clust[0]:+.5f}, {ci_clust[1]:+.5f}] (lebar = {width_clust:.5f}) <-- JUJUR!\")\nprint(f\"Faktor Under-Estimation Lebar  : {width_clust / width_naive:.2f}x lipat!\")\n\n# 2. Naive Paired t-test vs Diebold-Mariano HAC pada deret waktu AR(1) phi=0.80 (H0 sejati = 0!)\nT_ts = 250\nh_hor = 10\nd_ts = np.zeros(T_ts)\nfor t in range(1, T_ts):\n    d_ts[t] = 0.80 * d_ts[t - 1] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.5)\n\nt_naive, p_naive = stats.ttest_1samp(d_ts, popmean=0.0)\ndc = d_ts - d_ts.mean()\nhac = float(np.dot(dc, dc) / T_ts)\nfor k in range(1, h_hor):\n    hac += 2.0 * (1.0 - k / h_hor) * float(np.dot(dc[k:], dc[:-k]) / T_ts)\ndm_raw = float(d_ts.mean() / np.sqrt(max(hac / T_ts, 1e-15)))\nhln_fac = np.sqrt((T_ts + 1.0 - 2.0 * h_hor + h_hor * (h_hor - 1.0) / T_ts) / T_ts)\ndm_hln = dm_raw * hln_fac\np_dm = float(2.0 * stats.t.sf(abs(dm_hln), df=T_ts - 1))\n\nprint(f\"\\n=== 2. Naive Paired t-test vs Diebold-Mariano HAC (T={T_ts}, AR(1) phi=0.80, h={h_hor}, True Mean=0) ===\")\nprint(f\"Naive Paired t-test (ABAIKAN AUTOKORELASI) : t={t_naive:+.4f} | p={p_naive:.5f} (FALSE POSITIVE!)\")\nprint(f\"Diebold-Mariano HAC + HLN (JUJUR)          : t={dm_hln:+.4f} | p={p_dm:.5f} (TIDAK SIGNIFIKAN!)\")\n\n# 3. Statistical Significance vs Practical Significance (MDBE) pada N = 100.000\nN_big = 100_000\nmdbe = 0.0050\ndelta_obs = 0.0006\nse_big = 0.00018\nz_big = delta_obs / se_big\np_big = float(2.0 * stats.norm.sf(abs(z_big)))\nci_big_lo = delta_obs - 1.96 * se_big\nprint(f\"\\n=== 3. Jebakan N Raksasa (N={N_big:,}): Statistical vs Practical Significance ===\")\nprint(f\"Delta AUROC={delta_obs:+.4f} | z={z_big:.2f} | p={p_big:.6f} (Signifikan secara statistik!)\")\nprint(f\"Lower 95% CI={ci_big_lo:+.4f} vs MDBE={mdbe:+.4f} --> KEPUTUSAN BISNIS: TOLAK DEPLOY (ROI negatif!)\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Audit Naive Bootstrap vs Clustered Bootstrap (G=80 entitas x 15 baris = 1200) ===\nObserved Mean Loss Diff        : +0.00189\nNaive Row Bootstrap 95% CI     : [-0.00309, +0.00666] (lebar = 0.00975) <-- TERLALU SEMPIT!\nClustered Bootstrap 95% CI     : [-0.01586, +0.02165] (lebar = 0.03750) <-- JUJUR!\nFaktor Under-Estimation Lebar  : 3.84x lipat!\n\n=== 2. Naive Paired t-test vs Diebold-Mariano HAC (T=250, AR(1) phi=0.80, h=10, True Mean=0) ===\nNaive Paired t-test (ABAIKAN AUTOKORELASI) : t=+4.6971 | p=0.00000 (FALSE POSITIVE!)\nDiebold-Mariano HAC + HLN (JUJUR)          : t=+1.8692 | p=0.06277 (TIDAK SIGNIFIKAN!)\n\n=== 3. Jebakan N Raksasa (N=100,000): Statistical vs Practical Significance ===\nDelta AUROC=+0.0006 | z=3.33 | p=0.000858 (Signifikan secara statistik!)\nLower 95% CI=+0.0002 vs MDBE=+0.0050 --> KEPUTUSAN BISNIS: TOLAK DEPLOY (ROI negatif!)",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Audit Naive Bootstrap vs Clustered Bootstrap (G=80 entitas x 15 baris = 1200) ===\nObserved Mean Loss Diff        : +0.00189\nNaive Row Bootstrap 95% CI     : [-0.00309, +0.00666] (lebar = 0.00975) <-- TERLALU SEMPIT!\nClustered Bootstrap 95% CI     : [-0.01586, +0.02165] (lebar = 0.03750) <-- JUJUR!\nFaktor Under-Estimation Lebar  : 3.84x lipat!\n\n=== 2. Naive Paired t-test vs Diebold-Mariano HAC (T=250, AR(1) phi=0.80, h=10, True Mean=0) ===\nNaive Paired t-test (ABAIKAN AUTOKORELASI) : t=+4.6971 | p=0.00000 (FALSE POSITIVE!)\nDiebold-Mariano HAC + HLN (JUJUR)          : t=+1.8692 | p=0.06277 (TIDAK SIGNIFIKAN!)\n\n=== 3. Jebakan N Raksasa (N=100,000): Statistical vs Practical Significance ===\nDelta AUROC=+0.0006 | z=3.33 | p=0.000858 (Signifikan secara statistik!)\nLower 95% CI=+0.0002 vs MDBE=+0.0050 --> KEPUTUSAN BISNIS: TOLAK DEPLOY (ROI negatif!)",
          "explanation": "Membuktikan tiga jebakan statistik produksi: (1) Naive Row Bootstrap mempersempit 95% CI 3.84x lipat dibanding Clustered Bootstrap pada 80 entitas x 15 baris; (2) Naive paired t-test tertipu false positive (p<1e-5) pada deret AR(1) ber-mean nol sedangkan Diebold-Mariano HAC + HLN jujur (p=0.06277); (3) N=100k memicu p=0.000858 tetapi Lower CI (+0.0002) < MDBE (+0.0050) -> TOLAK DEPLOY.",
